        "text": "Step 3: If Denali starts walking \\( 4x \\) more dogs, her new total number of dogs becomes \\( 16 + 4x \\), and her new total pay is \\( (16 + 4x)p \\)."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 541,
