        "prefix_token_count": 182,
        "step_number": 4,
        "text": "Step 4: If \\( x \\) of Nate's dogs are reassigned to Denali, Denali's new total number of dogs becomes \\( 16 + x \\), and her new total pay is \\( (16 + x)p \\). Nate's new total number of dogs becomes \\( 12 - x \\), and his new total pay is \\( (12 - x)p \\)."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 755,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 756,
        "char_start": 545,
        "effective_step": 5,
