        "prefix_token_count": 254,
        "step_number": 5,
        "text": "Step 5: According to the problem, the ratio of Denali's pay to Nate's pay remains the same under both scenarios. Therefore, we can set up the equation:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{(16 + 4x)p}{(12 - x)p} = \\frac{(16 + x)p}{12p}\n\\]"
