        "effective_step": 6,
        "end_token_index": 300,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 301,
        "step_number": 6,
        "text": "Step 6: Simplify the equation by canceling out \\( p \\):\n\n\\[\n\\frac{16 + 4x}{12 - x} = \\frac{16 + x}{12}\n\\]"
      },
      {
